{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11102170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11102170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1110217001:1":{"text":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，战歌节初赛第一道试炼领取时间，即将截止！","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，战歌节初赛第一道试炼领取时间，即将截止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EFF701E0ADFE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110217002:1":{"text":"倒计时——五！四！三！二——","source_cn":"倒计时——五！四！三！二——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9352A03A1CBD48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110217003:1":{"text":"等一等！乌尔氏族想要领取试炼！","source_cn":"等一等！乌尔氏族想要领取试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D5E250A78AFA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110217004:2":{"text":"哦！曼卡拉可是很少见到这么精神的毛团呢！乌尔氏族……这个名字有点陌生啊！","source_cn":"哦！曼卡拉可是很少见到这么精神的毛团呢！乌尔氏族……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9E653AD7B670C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110217005:1":{"text":"你可以从现在开始记住这个名字。","source_cn":"你可以从现在开始记住这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1D10EB303F32A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},